ecoEye:'THE FOUNDATION',ecoTitle:'People. Processes. Solutions.<br><em>Connected by intelligence.</em>',ecoText:'Good decisions need the right people, sound processes and the right tools. We look at all three, because a decision is only as good as its implementation.',tabPeople:'People',tabProcesses:'Processes',tabSolutions:'Solutions',tabSpace:'AI space',
