aboutEye:'ABOUT GAIA PATH',aboutTitle:'Built on experience.<br><em>Driven by curiosity.</em>',aboutP1:'GAIA PATH is a founder-led, independent advisory practice for AI-supported decisions. We work with decision-makers in companies, public administrations and non-profit organizations, internationally.',aboutP2:'Founder Mehrzad (Λεωνίδας) Shariati brings experience across European and international organizations, including enterprise services, global HR transformation and satellite-enabled business models. His focus is on connecting business needs with executable solutions, and maintaining control when things become complex.',aboutP3:'No preferred platform. No predetermined answer. A commitment to understand what actually needs to be decided.',aboutLinkedIn:'Follow Mehrzad (Λεωνίδας) Shariati on LinkedIn',aboutCaption:'International perspective · Independent judgment',founderEditorialTitle:'A Word from Our Founder',founderEditorialTeaser:'A personal reflection on experience, perspective and finding the right path.',
